    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outta Gas? Outer Gas! </strong>In this unconventional gas station simulator, you take control over your very own space gas station and attend to your intergalactic customers\u2019 needs: fill up their tanks, provide them with some snacks and send them back on their cosmic journeys! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nail the perfect fuel fill-up</strong> to earn extra tips and keep your alien customers smiling (or oozing, or buzzing\u2014depending on their biology). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Galactic exploitation is your cup of tea?</strong> Then get excited to set up and protect your own mining rigs on the nearest planet! Space pirates and alien creatures won\u2019t make it easy to <strong>expand your gas station empire</strong>\u2014stay alert and be ready to <strong>defend</strong> what\u2019s yours.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625540/extras/33a25e17900576505ffae682f5499f7e.avif?t=1753379489\" width=616 height=214 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Serve a variety of customers</strong> by pumping gas into their vehicles\u2014just make sure to get the amount and fuel type right to maximize profit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your station</strong> with extra pumps and handy gadgets that make your job easier and keep the chaos under control.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expand your operation</strong> by setting up mining rigs to extract the fuel yourself and keep the supply flowing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend your business</strong> against space pirates and alien creatures who aren\u2019t too happy about your growing empire.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outer Gas is currently in early development stage and its progress will be updated regularly with new screenshots and gameplay footage.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outta Gas? Outer Gas! </strong>In this unconventional gas station simulator, you take control over your very own space gas station and attend to your intergalactic customers\u2019 needs: fill up their tanks, provide them with some snacks and send them back on their cosmic journeys! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nail the perfect fuel fill-up</strong> to earn extra tips and keep your alien customers smiling (or oozing, or buzzing\u2014depending on their biology). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Galactic exploitation is your cup of tea?</strong> Then get excited to set up and protect your own mining rigs on the nearest planet! Space pirates and alien creatures won\u2019t make it easy to <strong>expand your gas station empire</strong>\u2014stay alert and be ready to <strong>defend</strong> what\u2019s yours.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625540/extras/33a25e17900576505ffae682f5499f7e.avif?t=1753379489\" width=616 height=214 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Serve a variety of customers</strong> by pumping gas into their vehicles\u2014just make sure to get the amount and fuel type right to maximize profit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your station</strong> with extra pumps and handy gadgets that make your job easier and keep the chaos under control.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expand your operation</strong> by setting up mining rigs to extract the fuel yourself and keep the supply flowing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend your business</strong> against space pirates and alien creatures who aren\u2019t too happy about your growing empire.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outer Gas is currently in early development stage and its progress will be updated regularly with new screenshots and gameplay footage.</strong></p>",
